[00:04.50] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:04.50][by:已使用的昵称]
[00:04.54] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:04.59]Through the fish-eyed lens of tear stained eyes
[00:04.59]透过泪眼的鱼眼镜头
[00:12.62]I can barely define the shape of this moment in time
[00:12.62]我已难以认清此时此刻
[00:21.16]And far from flying high in clear blue skies
[00:21.16]我并非在湛蓝的天空中飞翔
[00:29.59]I'm spiraling down to the hole in the ground where I hide
[00:29.59]而是正盘旋下坠至地面藏匿的洞坑
[00:38.63]If you negotiate the minefield in the drive
[00:38.63]若你成功穿越道路上的地雷区
[00:46.93]And beat the dogs and cheat the cold electronic eyes
[00:46.93]打败犬狗，骗过冰冷的电子眼
[00:55.80]And if you make it past the shotguns in the hall
[00:55.80]若你成功躲过大厅里的火枪
[01:03.81]Dial the combination, open the priesthole
[01:03.81]输入密码，打开密室
[01:12.13]And if I'm in I'll tell you (What's behind the wall)
[01:12.13]如果我在里面，我会告诉你（墙后面有什么）
[01:15.32](Yahoo!)
[01:15.32]（呀呼！）
[01:17.01]
[01:20.40]There's a kid who had a big hallucination
[01:20.40]有个孩子热切地幻想着
[01:28.57]Making love to girls in magazines
[01:28.57]跟杂志里的女孩们亲热
[01:36.11]He wonders if you're sleeping with your new found faith
[01:36.11]他想着你是否与你的新欢共枕同眠
[01:44.60]Could anybody love him
[01:44.60]会有人爱他吗？
[01:50.33]Or is it just a crazy dream?
[01:50.33]亦或只是一场疯狂的梦境？
[01:56.67]
[02:08.89]And if I show you my dark side
[02:08.89]如果我把我的阴暗面展示给你
[02:16.24]Will you still hold me tonight?
[02:16.24]今夜你是否依旧将我抱紧？
[02:25.35]And if I open my heart to you
[02:25.35]如果我对你敞开心扉
[02:32.79]And show you my weak side
[02:32.79]让你看见我的脆弱
[02:37.01]What would you do?
[02:37.01]你会怎么办？
[02:42.67]Would you sell your story to Rolling Stone?
[02:42.67]你是否会把这个故事卖给《滚石》杂志？
[02:50.85]Would you take the children away
[02:50.85]你是否会把孩子们带走
[02:55.31]And leave me alone?
[02:55.31]丢下我一人？
[02:58.17]And smile in reassurance
[02:58.17]挂着安心的微笑
[03:02.21]As you whisper down the phone?
[03:02.21]对着电话筒低声说道？
[03:07.44]Would you send me packing?
[03:07.44]你是否会让我打包走人？
[03:13.44]Or would you take me home?
[03:13.44]还是说你会带我回家？
[03:19.19]
[04:00.56]Thought I oughta bare my naked feelings
[04:00.56]想着我应当流露我的真情
[04:08.68]Thought I oughta tear the curtain down
[04:08.68]想着我应当扯下窗帘
[04:16.34]I held the blade in trembling hands
[04:16.34]我颤抖的双手握着刀片
[04:20.28]Prepared to make it but just then the phone rang
[04:20.28]准备就此了结，但这时电话声响起
[04:29.43]I never had the nerve to make the final cut
[04:29.43]我还是没有勇气去完成这最后一刀
[04:33.52]“Hello? Listen, I think I've got it."
[04:33.52]“你好？听着，我想我搞定了。”
[04:37.52]
